{
  "_comment": "Member-path test vectors (docs/specs/included-tree.md, section 3). Each case lists the member paths of one tree as a source presents them: a string, or {\"hex\": ...} for bytes that are not UTF-8. The expected canonical order (null when there are errors), errors and warnings are written by hand.",
